OL,3,ANorse Atlantic suspends all flights as
OL,4,Ait faces potential collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Norwegian low cost carrier Norse
OL,7,FAtlantic Airways has suspended all
OL,8,Fflights as it rushes to resolve what it
OL,9,Fwarned is a critical financial
OL,10,Fsituation.
OL,12,FThe airline said if no solution can be
OL,13,Ffound, it intends to file for
OL,14,Fbankruptcy.
OL,16,FThe airline uses a fleet of 12 Boeing
OL,17,F787 aircraft on long-haul routes from a
OL,18,Fnumber of European airports, including
OL,19,FLondon Gatwick, Rome and Oslo.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
