OL,3,ANorse Atlantic suspends all flights as
OL,4,Ait faces potential collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrior to the suspension of flights, it
OL,7,Fwas advertising services from London to
OL,8,FOrlando, Cape Town, Bangkok and Phuket.
